						<p style="Normal" margin-left="0" margin-right="0" text-indent="0" text-align="left" list-style-type="none" tabs="inherit">Strength I Live Load Maximum Moments, Maximum Shears, and Moments associated with Maximum Shears (Undistributed) </p>
