						<p style="Normal" margin-left="inherit" margin-right="inherit" text-indent="inherit" text-align="inherit" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">Array of Strand Pattern to Create Mathcad Plot: Top Row of tendsect = Bottom Row of Strands in Beam</p>
						<p style="Normal" margin-left="inherit" margin-right="inherit" text-indent="inherit" text-align="inherit" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">
							<tab/>12 = no strand, </p>
						<p style="Normal" margin-left="inherit" margin-right="inherit" text-indent="inherit" text-align="inherit" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">
							<sp count="16"/>11 = draped strand</p>
						<p style="Normal" margin-left="0" margin-right="0" text-indent="0" text-align="left" list-style-type="none" tabs="inherit">
							<tab/>10 = fully bonded strand, </p>
